# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: RDPServer.
Package: RDPServer
Section: Network
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, CryptRandom (>= 0.12)
Components: Apps.Network.!RDPServer (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rdpserver
Description: Remote Desktop (RDP) server for the RISC OS desktop
 Use this desktop from Windows Remote Desktop, Microsoft's Windows App,
 FreeRDP or !RDPClient, with TLS 1.2, sound and logins. The server
 runs as a module, so it keeps serving when the desktop isn't
 multitasking.
Build-Map: !RDPServer -> Apps/Network/!RDPServer
Build-Notice: RDPServer, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-rdpserver/releases
 .
 RDPServer is under the MIT licence and includes libxrdp and Mbed TLS
 (Apache 2.0) and font8x8 (public domain). Licences follow.
Build-Copyright: !RDPServer/Licences
